  "goodToKnow": "Die Soziologie is sociology, with the stress on the last syllable: zo-tsyo-lo-GEE. Der Soziologe (weak noun: den Soziologen) and die Soziologin are the specialists. The German sociologists Max Weber, Georg Simmel and Niklas Luhmann are among the best known in the field. Don't confuse it with Sozialkunde, a school subject that covers politics and society, or Sozialarbeit (social work)."
